00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:44.460
Mew!

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.580
Now, onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:10.870
Go!

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:15.580
“Tales of the Luminous Maze Forest and You”?

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:18.910
Huh?! It’s nothing like
the Ponyta I’ve seen!

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:20.840
I’d like to see it!

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:21.670
Me too!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:23.090
I want to catch it!

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:25.420
Then all of you should go.

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:28.830
Are you trying to ask me
to help Gallop?

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:30.310
